The prior 'feat: add school MVP' commit only added a sidebar link;
none of the actual page code was ever committed, which is why
/admin/schools and /school/[slug] both 404'd. Adds:
- app/admin/schools (list, create, manage/assign)
- app/school/[slug] (public school page)
- app/school/[slug]/principal (principal dashboard)
- supabase/migrations/20260727_schools.sql, corrected to match the
  live database (tutor role preserved in the role check constraint,
  profiles_school_staff_read policy rewritten to use security-definer
  helper functions instead of a self-referencing subquery that caused
  infinite recursion in production).
